## IMPORTANT CONSTRAINTS

1. **NO self-signup** — only Super Admin can create institute accounts
2. **Data isolation is critical** — always use `institutes/{instituteId}/collectionName` path, never top-level collections
3. **instituteId** is determined at runtime from auth — never trust client-provided values for security-critical paths
4. **Super Admin** can read all institutes but institute users can only access their own path
5. **Firestore streams** (`onSnapshot`) for real-time updates on students, payments, expenses, courses, batches
6. **Registration numbers** must be generated via Firestore transaction (atomic, no duplicates)
7. **EmailJS config** is per-institute — read from their config doc before sending emails
8. **Features flags** — check `config.features.xxx` before rendering any feature-gated module
9. **Password Reset** — Firebase `sendPasswordResetEmail` for forgot password
10. **No hardcoded institute names** — everything comes from `config.name`, `config.reg_prefix` etc.
11. All currency in Indian Rupees (₹), date format DD/MM/YYYY for display, YYYY-MM-DD for storage
12. Indian Financial Year: April to March (FY 2026-27 = April 2026 to March 2027)

